---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /services/index.html
nav: services
title: Services and Prices | Solecare Glasgow East
description: Foot care services and prices for home visits across Glasgow East. Nail care, diabetic checks, corns and hard skin, ingrown toenails.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Services and prices</h1>
    <p>Every visit includes travel within the areas we cover, and all equipment and materials used during your treatment. There are no extra charges.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="service-list">
    {% for service in services.list %}
    <div class="service-item">
      <h3>{{ service.name }}</h3>
      {% for para in service.detail %}
      <p>{{ para }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
      <span class="service-price">&pound;{{ service.price }} <small>&nbsp;{{ service.duration }}</small></span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <h3>Booking for a family member?</h3>
    <p>Many visits are arranged by sons and daughters on behalf of a parent. Just get in touch and let us know you are enquiring for someone else, and we will take it from there.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Make an Enquiry</a>
  </div>
</section>
